linear - start to end same speed

ease-in - slow start

ease-out - slow end

ease-in-out - slow start, slow end, but in middle fast

cubic-bezier(n,n,n,n) - Lets you define your own values in a cubic-bezier function

Animation-fill-mode

none - Default value. Animation will not apply any styles to the element before or after it is executing

forwards - after my animation starts set the properties at 100% key frame

backwards - before my animation starts set the properties at 0% key frame

both - backwards + forwards

